        name    f0;
        type    faceSet;
        action  subset;
        source  boxToFace;
        box     (0.090 0.000 0.000) (0.110 0.010 0.010);
    }
);
```

Why this works:
- `patchToFace` guarantees all selected faces are boundary faces.
- `subset + boxToFace` trims to your exact required inlet footprint.
